Topi Linkala wrote...

> Querying inventory like in e (what do you want to eat? ABC ?*).
> 
> If you press ? doesn't that mean that you'll check waht those possible 
> edibles are. And if your blind shouldn't that mean that you do it by touch?

No.  Pressing ? is a query by you, the player, as to what is available
to eat.  I believe it is assumed that the character keeps mental track
of all items s/he has at any given time.  This would explain, for
example, why the "i" command uses no game-time.  The character is not
checking his possessions, you the player are.  Some variants of
NetHack even have a permanent inventory window, eliminating the need
for ever even using "i".

